    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rfx2](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rfx2) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 61.636 depth occurred on Oct 10 2025 41km E of Manay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 7.1014 longitude 126.8879. It impacted 61234 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
